<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2PE" style="id" />
  <para style="h">2 Pita</para>
  <para style="toc1">Neletes Namun Pita Mey Mehiy</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Pita</para>
  <para style="toc3">2PI</para>
  <para style="mt">Neletes Namun Pita Mey Mehiy</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2PE 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 1:1" />Den Simon Pita, net mugumgu wa nahal non Tigsas Kraēs.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 1:1">Hiy kimi a melep nēdēmtig mey a nitiy wē yeh haytēyēh mi nēdēmtig nonmem, heylō van litiy togtog tenenen non Ḡod wa Ivaēh nongēn, Tigsas Kraēs.<verse eid="2PE 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 1:2" />!Nasgōp wa natm̄at niōyheg kimi, niōyheg kimi, veg kimi nēglal Ḡod wa Tigsas, Welan nongēn!<verse eid="2PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Atmi mugumgu maymay tō nimētwumi nitgolgol</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 1:3" />Ḡod mal lep me hiy gēn nahaphap del a gēn so tēy nēh lap aē, wa totog togolgol van aē. Kē mal lep me nahaphap geh nan mi naman nonon. Gēn tētēy vēh nēh togolgol veg gēn mēglal kē a mōlōl tō gēn mi nēlēn̄as wa mi nēmētwōn mey a nitiy togolgol. <verse eid="2PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 1:4" />Mi nahaphap geh gōh en, kē melep me hiy gen navatvat mey nēwē a nitiy wē yeh. Kē melep me so kimi tuqultiwag vēh van lēh non Ḡod, ba van yak den namyōs het telemyam agōh.<verse eid="2PE 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 1:5" />Veg bege geh gōh en, atmi mugumgu maymay malig van tō so biyin̄ se van nēmētwumi mey netgolgol hiy nēdēmtig,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2PE 1:5">biyin̄ se van nololmeyen hiy nēmētwumi mey netgolgol,<verse eid="2PE 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 1:6" />biyin̄ se van namhuy hiy nololmeyen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2PE 1:6">biyin̄ se van nētnegay liwo hiy namhuy,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2PE 1:6">biyin̄ se van nitiy togtog togolgol hiy nētnegay liwo,<verse eid="2PE 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 1:7" />biyin̄ se van netet lōlwē hiy nitiy togtog togolgol,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2PE 1:7">wa biyin̄ se van natamtam hiy netet lōlwē.<verse eid="2PE 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 1:8" />Kimi nēglal Welan nongēn Tigsas Kraēs, tō kimi mugumgu so galeg nahap a kē nemyōs. So nage del gōh ta-aē tō mi kimi, wa tō vaga kē tēwē malig se tō van en, togtō nēwan ta-aē mi kimi. Tō namgumgu ēwē namuy tit yeghuquy vēhte, ba kimi taktig nahaphap a kimi gagaleg veg Kraēs. <verse eid="2PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 1:9" />Ba so nage del gōh wo tateh tō mi net vitwag en, togtō net nan namatbē, wa nēdēmdēm nonon namaltē. Wa kē mololqōn̄ so Ḡod mal oh wenwen tō kē den negengenyeg nonon tam̄ag.<verse eid="2PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 1:10" />Yathithik wa yatētētek, kimi nēglal vatag so Ḡod mal ōlōl kimi wa mal vonyak vatag kimi. Kē mavatvat so nilep kal kimi alge. Bastō atmi mugumgu se mi navaksami so tēy navatvat nan. So kimi wo mak tēytēymat kimi bahaphap mey nēwē gōh en, kimi tit sisgoy vēhte. <verse eid="2PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 1:11" />Tō Ḡod telep vasgēt kimi mi namlaklak van lepnō yon̄ mey a notogtog lap vaga, napnō yon̄ non Welan wa Ivaēh nongēn Tigsas Kraēs.<verse eid="2PE 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pita so niak dēmlok kēy veg Boyoy Ēwē</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 1:12" />Bastō bege gōh, nok so ak dēmlok kimi vaga bahaphap geh nan. No nēglal so kimi mal m̄ōleg aē, tō mal tig maymay lēhēyhēywē a kimi mal ēglal vatag. <verse eid="2PE 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 1:13" />Ba nok dēm so kē netnenen so nok ak matyak kimi vaga mi navap dēmlok gōh mahē a no nēh leptō agōh. <verse eid="2PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 1:14" />Veg no nēglal so et misin hōn te no tavan den kimi, qele Welan nongēn Tigsas Kraēs mal vasemlō me hiy no. <verse eid="2PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 1:15" />No temgumgu mi navaksek vaga tō so kimi tēdēm lok vēh naln̄ek, so no wo mamat.<verse eid="2PE 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pita tiwag mi ige tin̄qoy tegtegha met nihin̄yeg non Kraēs mi namtay</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 1:16" />Yēhē, kemem ige hal et dam te nakaka tam̄ag mahē a kemem mavasemlō van naman wa navanvan vagyō non Welan nongēn Tigsas Kraēs. Namaymay non Tigsas et nakaka te mey net mitin̄ yak so niwseg nēdēmdēm non net. Ba kemem metgeh nitiy maymay ne man nonon mi namtamem.<verse eid="2PE 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 1:17" />Veg kamtēl mahgemamtēl moyon̄teg Imam Ḡod, mahē nitiy lēn̄as nonon mihin̄yeg me, tō kē mōyheg Tigsas mi nēlēn̄as wa nēdēmap, wa mavap lō so, “Igōh kē intik a no natam kē, wa no nemlaklak veg kē.” <verse eid="2PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 1:18" />Naln̄an en, kamtēl moyon̄teg a mavan me den alge, mahē kamtēl tiwag mi kē luwutwut yon̄.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 9:1-8">Mak 9:1-8</ref></char></note><verse eid="2PE 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ige lēgēlgēg nivasemlō so noyoy veg Tigsas en, ikē hēyhēywē.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 1:19" />Tō nohohole non ige lēgēlgēg nivasemlō so noyoy veg Tigsas en, ikē hēyhēywē. Ba gēn nēglal yeh so nohohole gōh maktig. Tō itōk so kimi van sisqet me so yon̄teg galgalsi, veg nohohole nan qele nuqul a nihin̄yeg lemlēglēg. Kē nihin̄yeg dēn̄ lengongomtap a lōqōn̄ a Tigsas so nivan lokse me, qele nam̄ha a nihatig wa nihin̄yeg lelo taqami. <verse eid="2PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 1:20" />Tō hag apwon yeh, kimi so ēglal so namanig ne vavap lēgēlgēg Layapyap Yon̄ en, namanig nan et van te me den nēdēmdēm non net ēwē. <verse eid="2PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 1:21" />Veg tateh vavap lēgēlgēg geh nivan me heylō lemyōs non net, ba Nuvu Yon̄ mōyheg net so nihole lō nohohole non Ḡod.<verse eid="2PE 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2PE 2" />
  <para style="s">Etgoy ige vatvatgo galgal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 2:1" />Kimi nēglal vatag so am̄ag ige lēgēlgēg galgal motog tiwag tō mi ige sil. Tō qelese nen, ige vatvatgo galgal notog se tiwag mi kimi. Kēy vatne bat navatvatne galgal a tak hethet vēh net. Kēy lēn̄lēn̄teg Welan a mēwēl yak tō kēy, ak tō so Ḡod tēvēvēg het nowmat kēy aē. <verse eid="2PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 2:2" />Woqse et tadam namtehal nonoy van lemyōs mey nehet. Tō veg kēy en, ige tohole hethet bemtehal ne hēyhēywē.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Navavap ‘namtehal ne hēyhēywē’ en, namanig nan ige Krēstēn wa Noyoy Ēwē. Nahan nan nivan den nohohole non Tigsas a mi Jon 14:6, “Ino namtehal, wa nēhēyhēywē, wa nēh.”</char></note> <verse eid="2PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 2:3" />Veg ige vatvatgo galgal maygay ēwē bēsēm, tō kēy mitin̄ yak ēwē hag nakaka so weseg nēdēmdēm nonmi aē. Ba Ḡod nenyē kēy vaga, wa et matbē te den kēy, so nivēvēg kēy.<verse eid="2PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ige het tit yowveteg vēhte nēvēvēg non Ḡod</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 2:4" />Dēm lok qeleave Ḡod mēvēvēg ige het tam̄ag. Veg kimi nēglal vatag so me am̄ag en, mahē ige in̄sel megengenyeg en, Ḡod et tēygoy te nēvēvēg den kēy, ba kē mēyēt kēy wa mēvētleg kēy lemlēglēgsil a wōsōy so tog dēyē nēvēvēg nonoy. <verse eid="2PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 2:5" />Wa namyam tam̄ag en, kē mēvēvēg ige het mi nililip. Ba Noah en, net botoytoy nele tenenen, Ḡod metgoy kē tiwag mi ige bul liviyō nonon. <verse eid="2PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 2:6" />Tō napnō Sodom tiwag mi Ḡomorah en, Ḡod mēvēvēg kōyō, a nep me gen sabun kōyō. Ba nēvēvēg gōh en, ikē nēvēglal ne vēvēg a Ḡod tēvētleg van hiy ige a et dēmap te Ḡod. <verse eid="2PE 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 2:7" />Ba Ḡod mavaēh net tenenen vitwag den nep nan. Ikē Lot,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Genesis 19:1-29</char></note> a kē moyon̄yon̄ ninhet veg bēmētwun ige et behelhel nele. <verse eid="2PE 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 2:8" />Net tenenen gōh, kē notogtog tiwag mi kēy. Tō vel qōn̄ kē niyon̄yon̄teg wa nietet namgumgu behelhel nele en, tō kē moyon̄teg nehet aē veg nalo taqan newenwen so tatag nēmētwun Ḡod.<verse eid="2PE 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 2:9" />Ige a nēdēmap Welan en, kē tavaēh vēh kēy den nem̄eygal. Kē nēglal aē. Ba ige a et dēmap te kē en, kē tēyēt maymay kēy dēn̄ lōqōn̄ bēvēvēg ige del. <verse eid="2PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 2:10" />Ḡod tēvēvēg yakhagyeh ige a et tog te leln̄e yon̄teg wa damdam namyōs het ne taqn̄ige a niak lemlem net. Kēy nelem̄ag wa nosotel, tō kēy et mētēgteg te so hole legelge ige a nēlēn̄as non Ḡod aē mi kēy. <verse eid="2PE 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 2:11" />Ba ige in̄sel gōh en, kēy et lep lok te nohohole het hiy kēy. Hēywē so ige in̄sel namaymay wowoh wa naman nonoy nilwo, ba kēy et hole legelge te so vēvēg ige het nan van lengon Welan.<verse eid="2PE 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">?Ige vatvatgo het qeleave?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 2:12" />Ige vatvatgo het qele nahaphap qiyig tuytuy a nēdēmdēm nonoy tateh. Namyōs nonoy vēlēs nitig helem̄ag kēy, tō kēy hohole hethet lahaphap mey a kēy et ēglal tē. Qele nahaphap tuytuy a net nilep wa niwuh mat begengen en, Ḡod tēvēvēg kēy qeleanen, tō kēy teqleqlen̄ a teqleqlen̄. <verse eid="2PE 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 2:13" />Kēy mak nehet tō nayseyse nonoy noyon̄yon̄ ninhet. Kēy malaklak betrotron̄ a et litiy qōn̄ nan te. Kē qele nanye haphap a niakak m̄usm̄us neleleh. Nēmētwuy en, bakak soloteg vēlēs nokolkol nonmi veg kē sēsē kēy bagalgal nonoy. <verse eid="2PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 2:14" />Nēdēmdēm nonoy nōyheg notogay het, ba namaygay nan tit bah vēhte den kēy. Tō kēy tewseg me ige mey a nēdēmdēm nonoy nem̄geygey. Tō namyōs ne sēm nilwo lelo taqay. !Ba kēy notog leln̄e vipdeg!<verse eid="2PE 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 2:15" />Kēy muwulyis den namtehal mey netnenen tō mavan ba meqlen̄, ba madam namtehal non Balaam, ēntēn Beor, a kē natam nēwēlwēl nonon bemgumgu het.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Numbers 22-24.</char></note> <verse eid="2PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 2:16" />Ba nodon̄ki vitwag, a tit hole vēhte qele net, mohole van hiy Balaam mi naln̄e et, wa mōlgontegoy net lēgēlgēg gōh so nitigoy kē den nēdēmdēm qaqa.<verse eid="2PE 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 2:17" />Ige vatvatgo het gōh nilwo yeghuquy ēwē qeleso newel a tateh bē alon, si so namlēg a nelen̄ wuh musuwyeg yak kēy. Ba ige gōh en, wōsōy a nemlēglēgsil mal tēymat veg kēy.<verse eid="2PE 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 2:18" />Veg kēy m̄eygal ige mey a tiqyo van yak ēwē tō den ige a notog legengenyeg. Kēy hole sotel namyōs het ne taqn̄ige, ba nēdēmdēm nan yeghuquy. <verse eid="2PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 2:19" />Kēy vatvat galgal van hiy ige sil so kēy totog m̄ōleg galgalsi. Ba ige vatvatgo het nan, negengenyeg newelan goy kēy, tō kēy damdam ēwē namyōs het nonoy. Kēy qeleso ige slev. Veg nahap a nilalaket goy net vitwag en, kē nivan me neslev nonon.<verse eid="2PE 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 2:20" />Veg sowo Welan wa Ivaēh nongēn Tigsas Kraēs mukēg taywah kēy tō den namyōs het telemyam gōh en, ba mey atgiy kēy van gon lokse legengenyeg, tō namyōs het nan nilalaket lokse goy kēy. Bastō kēy mitiy het den am̄ag. <verse eid="2PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 2:21" />Veg, sowo kēy tēglal vēh te tō namtehal tenenen en, tiy wē yeh mi kēy, den a kēy nēglal galsi ba mitig kēlē namtehal ne le yon̄ a Ḡod melep van hiy kēy.<verse eid="2PE 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2PE 2:22" />Bastō namtevuy nivasemlō me navap tēngeg hēyhēywē tam̄ag a mavap so, “Notok mavan tō megen lok nōlōlō nonon mahgen,” wa tō “Noqo a mal suwsuw vatag ōk, menhiy lok van leqlēs lem.”<verse eid="2PE 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2PE 3" />
  <para style="s">Tigsas tavan lokse me so nivēvēg nage del</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 3:1" />Yēhē yaplupluk. Igōhkē neletes namuk vōyō negi van hiy kimi. Van leletes vōyō namuk gōh en, nok so hole matyak ēwē kimi, so kimi dēmlok nēdēmdēm tenenen nonmi. <verse eid="2PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 3:2" />Nok so ak dēmlok kimi veg nohohole non ige lēgēlgēg yon̄ tam̄ag, tiwag mi nele non Welan Ivaēh nongēn, a kemem ige hal mavasemlō tō van hiy kimi.<verse eid="2PE 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 3:3" />Yakhagyeh, itōk so kimi ēglal so qiyig gōh, a sisqet babah ne qōn̄ en, ige boboyboyheg tavan me. Kēy tadam bemtehal nemyōs het nonoy, tō kēy toboyboyheg a tavap wo, <verse eid="2PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 3:4" />“?Tō qeleave ēnōk? ?Tigsas mavatvat tō aē so nivan lok me, ba kē ave ēnōk? Mal tivig qēt ige tamatmayge nongēn tam̄ag ba nahaphap et leh hōn te, meqtēg yak tō naqtēqtēg ne mayam gaydēn̄ qiyig agōh.”<verse eid="2PE 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 3:5" />Kēy galingoy so am̄ag Ḡod mitin̄ namlēg lōtōk wa namyam mi nohohole nonon. Kē mak so namyam gōh mēwētlō den nēbē wa heylō nēbē. <verse eid="2PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 3:6" />Wa tō, mi nēbē gōh en, kē mēvēvēg ige telemyam am̄ag mi nililip, wa kēy mamat qēt. <verse eid="2PE 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 3:7" />Ba nohohole a mitin̄ namyam en, nohohole gōhkē mal gatgoy namlēg wa namyam gōh tō so van lep. Wa Ḡod nitēygoy namyam bōqōn̄ a kē tēvēvēg wa tuwuh ige a et dēmap te kē.<verse eid="2PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 3:8" />Yēhē bulbulsal, nitog galingoy nage vitwag agōh. Van lengon Welan nēte 1,000 en, qeleso nōqōn̄ vitwag, wa tō nōqōn̄ vitwag en, qeleso nēte 1,000. <verse eid="2PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 3:9" />Welan et mēlē te van lavatvat nonon, qele a yatkel et dēmdēm so kē nemlē. Ba kē notogtog muhuy hiy kimi, veg kē et buste so net vitwag niwuh qelen̄, ba kē nemyōs so ige del dēmleh. <verse eid="2PE 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 3:10" />Ba nōqōn̄ non Welan tavan me qele net batan̄tan̄hephep vitwag.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Mathiw 24:42-44</char></note> Tō lōqōn̄ nan namlēg teqlen̄ mi navaliqōqō liwo len̄, tō nep sew tegen qēt niyinyintey hag lōtōk. Tō namyam gōh wa nage del telemyam en, kēy tavan me temtawle hiy Ḡod.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yatkel hohole tam̄ag mayap so neves gōh qelegōh, “Tō namyam gōh wa vel haphap del telemyam en, kēy teqlen̄ qēt.”</char></note><verse eid="2PE 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 3:11" />?Ba Ḡod tuwuh qelen̄ nage del qeleanen, bastō kimi so akteg? Atmi tog yoyon̄ wa dēmap Ḡod <verse eid="2PE 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 3:12" />mahē a kimi so dēmdēyē nōqōn̄ non Ḡod. Tō itōk so kimi mugumgu maymay so nōqōn̄ nen nivanvan ēgē me. Lōqōn̄ non Ḡod, namlēg wa niyinyintey del en, nep tegen qēt.<verse eid="2PE 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 3:13" />Ba gēn dēmdēyē nōtōq gayaq wa namyam gayaq mey nēwē tatag navatvat nonon, namyam mey a ige del wa tawye haphap hay alon en tetnenen.<verse eid="2PE 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tog wenwen, ba etgoy navatgo het mey a tiple weseg yak kimi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 3:14" />Bastō yēhē bulbulsal, veg kimi dēmdēyē megōh, mugumgu mi navaksami so tog wenwen, tog togolgol, wa tog tam̄at lengon. <verse eid="2PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 3:15" />Atmi dēmsas so Welan nitog muhuy tō so nivaēh ige sil nonon. Haytēyēh qele ēthēngēn Pol, a gēn natam yeh, mayap tō van hiy kimi tatag nēmnay a Ḡod melep van hiy kē. <verse eid="2PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 3:16" />Van leletes namun Pol en vaga kē nihole gatay nahaphap geh agōh. Ba yatkel hohole namun van leletes en, et towoyig te so ēglal m̄ōleg galsi. Tō yatkel et a nēqtēy nowon en, kēy wulyis nam̄e dēmdēm nan, qeleso kēy muwulyis se Nayapyap Yon̄ tegtegha. Ba kēy toyowōlsēn yow en, Ḡod tuwuh wa tēvēvēg kēy.<verse eid="2PE 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 3:17" />Bastō, yēhē bulbulsal veg kimi mēglal vatag bege gōh en, etgoy galsi kimi tō so kimi tit dam vēhte nagalgal non ige helhel nele wa tit sisgoy vēhte den nēdēmtig maymay nonmi. <verse eid="2PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 3:18" />Ba motow mi nasgōp wa nololmeyen non Welan wa Ivaēh nongēn Tigsas Kraēs.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 3:18">!Ōl liwo kē mi nēlēn̄as qiyig gōh wa gaydēn̄ a babah ne qōn̄! Qeleanen.<verse eid="2PE 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 3" />
</usx>